        "pre_text": "OUR PROCESS",
        "heading": "True Ranch to Table",
        "heading_size": "h1",
        "text": "<p>Unlike others, we oversee every step of the process to ensure  exceptional quality at every step in the process. We raise, feed, and  process all of our cattle in our own facilities.<\/p>",
